  "description": "*\"You're destined to be devoured by a beast.\"*\n\nEver since he was a child, Ui-Ju had heard his grandmother tell him that he had committed a grave sin in a past life and to always be wary of beasts. He dismissed it as nonsense and didn’t give it much thought, but then he began having strange, eerie dreams involving his longtime childhood friend Sa-Yeon and a mysterious boarder named Do-Yun, and her suspicions about the two of them began to grow... Which one of them is actually that beast?!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
